[{:db/id 17592186064311 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-5c789989-28b9-52e0-ac72-a0f8b7d66a60"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-5c789989-28b9-52e0-ac72-a0f8b7d66a60" :question/id #uuid "5c789989-28b9-52e0-ac72-a0f8b7d66a60" :question/math-academy-id "q-138860" :question/problem "Consider the function $y=\\sqrt[3]{\\frac{({x}^{2}+2)^{6}}{3x+6}}.$ The derivative of this function is given by\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}=\\frac{({x}^{2}+2)(11{x}^{2}+24x-2)}{g(x)}.\n$$\n\nFind the function $g(x).$" :question/worked-solution "Our function can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =\\sqrt[3]{\\frac{({x}^{2}+2)^{6}}{3x+6}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt[3]{({x}^{2}+2)^{6}}}{\\sqrt[3]{3x+6}} \\\\  & =\\frac{({x}^{2}+2)^{6/3}}{(3x+6)^{1/3}} \\\\  & =\\frac{({x}^{2}+2)^{2}}{(3x+6)^{1/3}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFirst, we take the natural logarithm of both sides and use the quotient and power rules for logarithms:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{ln}⁡y & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{({x}^{2}+2)^{2}}{(3x+6)^{1/3}}) \\\\ \\operatorname{ln}⁡y & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡(({x}^{2}+2)^{2})-\\operatorname{ln}⁡((3x+6)^{1/3}) \\\\ \\operatorname{ln}⁡y & =2\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}+2)-\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3x+6)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we differentiate both sides with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{ln}⁡y) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}+2)-\\frac{1}{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡(3x+6)) \\\\ \\frac{1}{y}\\cdot {y}^{′} & =2\\cdot \\frac{1}{{x}^{2}+2}\\cdot 2x-\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot \\frac{1}{3x+6}\\cdot 3 \\\\ \\frac{{y}^{′}}{y} & =\\frac{4x}{{x}^{2}+2}-\\frac{1}{3x+6}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nNow, we solve for ${y}^{′}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{′} & =y(\\frac{4x}{{x}^{2}+2}-\\frac{1}{3x+6})\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute $y=\\sqrt[3]{\\frac{({x}^{2}+2)^{6}}{3x+6}}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{′} & =\\sqrt[3]{\\frac{({x}^{2}+2)^{6}}{3x+6}}(\\frac{4x}{{x}^{2}+2}-\\frac{1}{3x+6}) \\\\  & =\\sqrt[3]{\\frac{({x}^{2}+2)^{6}}{3x+6}}(\\frac{4x(3x+6)-({x}^{2}+2)}{({x}^{2}+2)(3x+6)}) \\\\  & =\\sqrt[3]{\\frac{({x}^{2}+2)^{6}}{3x+6}}(\\frac{11{x}^{2}+24x-2}{({x}^{2}+2)(3x+6)}) \\\\  & =\\frac{({x}^{2}+2)(11{x}^{2}+24x-2)}{\\sqrt[3]{(3x-6)^{4}}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\ng(x)=\\sqrt[3]{(3x-6)^{4}}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-8c497ffd-4cca-50b5-a7fc-dc93d720ea25"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-8c497ffd-4cca-50b5-a7fc-dc93d720ea25" :answer-field/id #uuid "8c497ffd-4cca-50b5-a7fc-dc93d720ea25" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-c88b7035-072c-5214-bd55-1804a6aa0ae7" :answer-field/choices ["answer-ec4a59e0-949a-5cc8-91d2-09ecb393925e" "answer-80386a1f-1c68-542d-97ab-e6ec02fe80f1" "answer-9eb339eb-1cc4-5d35-9e83-6c06760cd1fe" "answer-c88b7035-072c-5214-bd55-1804a6aa0ae7" "answer-e2ae8cb1-1ad1-519a-a9ae-fc0f9b33b01f"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ec4a59e0-949a-5cc8-91d2-09ecb393925e" :answer/id #uuid "ec4a59e0-949a-5cc8-91d2-09ecb393925e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\sqrt[3]{(x+2)^{4}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-80386a1f-1c68-542d-97ab-e6ec02fe80f1" :answer/id #uuid "80386a1f-1c68-542d-97ab-e6ec02fe80f1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "9\\sqrt[3]{(x+2)^{2}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9eb339eb-1cc4-5d35-9e83-6c06760cd1fe" :answer/id #uuid "9eb339eb-1cc4-5d35-9e83-6c06760cd1fe" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt[3]{(3x+6)^{2}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c88b7035-072c-5214-bd55-1804a6aa0ae7" :answer/id #uuid "c88b7035-072c-5214-bd55-1804a6aa0ae7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt[3]{(3x+6)^{4}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e2ae8cb1-1ad1-519a-a9ae-fc0f9b33b01f" :answer/id #uuid "e2ae8cb1-1ad1-519a-a9ae-fc0f9b33b01